  vendorName: Handyman Harrison
  offerText: Your windows are rattling terribly in the wind. Pay my hourly rate,
    and I will seal them up so you can actually enjoy some peace and warmth.
  acceptResultText: Harrison works quickly. The awful draft stops completely, and
    your room becomes wonderfully quiet and cozy.
  rejectResultText: You refuse to pay him. A gust of wind shatters a loose pane of
    glass, leaving you shivering in the freezing cold.
